	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Reaction</strong></p><p><em>Trigger: the [[lookup @name lowercase]] is within 30 ft. of a creature other than itself that has blood, and that creature takes &amp;reference[Piercing] or &amp;reference[Slashing] damage.</em></p><p><strong>[[/save wisdom]]{Wisdom Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] goes into a blood frenzy: it has &amp;reference[Advantage] on &amp;reference[attack rolls] against creatures that have blood, but mindlessly attacks the nearest prey that isn't an ally with its bite attack until it has eaten something or until 1 minute has passed.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No effect.</p></li></ul><p>This ability doesn't function if the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can't take a Reaction.</p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
